      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert AI meeting assistant. Analyze the provided meeting transcript and return ONLY a single, valid JSON object. \n\nCRITICAL REQUIREMENTS:\n- Output raw JSON only. \n- Do NOT include markdown code blocks, backticks (```), or the word \"json\" at the beginning/end.\n- Ensure all key names and string values use valid double quotes.\n\nJSON Schema:\n{\n  \"summary\": \"Brief 2-3 sentence overview of the meeting\",\n  \"decisions\": [\n    \"Decision 1\", \n    \"Decision 2\"\n  ],\n  \"action_items\": [\n    {\n      \"task\": \"Task description\",\n      \"owner\": \"Name or 'Unassigned'\",\n      \"deadline\": \"YYYY-MM-DD, specific day, or 'Not specified'\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"open_questions\": [\n    \"Question 1\"\n  ]\n}\n\nTranscript:\nTranscript:\n{{ $json?.text || $json?.message?.text || \"\" }}",
